        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[1rem] text-ink mb-2">"Where's the policy?"</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-[.875rem] leading-relaxed">A medical emergency means someone needs a policy number, fast, and you're twelve hours behind.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-6 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 border border-hair rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-muted">
          {% icon "users", "w-[18px] h-[18px]" %}
        </div>
