        <p class="text-muted text-[.875rem] leading-relaxed">Tax deadlines, FD renewals and property dues don't pause because you're abroad.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card border border-hair rounded-[14px] p-6 shadow-card">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 border border-hair rounded-[8px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-muted">
